  tools/pla-specs/apply_0_9_4_dev1.py over out/local-093r242 (--vanilla ../lateralus-infantry-20261110/vanilla), 8 checks. Spetsnaz Alpha stand-off
  loadout (option 1511 -> unit 354): RPG-30 carriers 4 -> 6 (members 587 and 589, AK-107 riflemen, get SpecialWeaponId 169; 1 round each, the
  vanilla disposable pattern). Squad stays 14 men; option cost (+5) and the close-quarters loadout (unit 131) unchanged. Not yet seen in game.
- 2026-11-20 14:2x PST, thread 1567745029781454889 (Osama: "I liked how Tanks and IFV damage was before we removed the cover ... a % damage reduction for IFVs and
  etc across the board", "no no hook ... change all the values", "like tank cannon and autocannons"). DATA: section 2 of apply_0_9_4_dev1.py (batch now 14 checks).
